error[reserved-name] 3:7-3:14
  (let [Passing 1
        ^^^^^^^
  Passing is a variant of Level, so it cannot name a value.
  A capitalized name is a variant when an enum in scope has a variant of that name. Name a value with a lowercase name.
  Fix: passing

